ul.li:
XML represented as lexical string:

      DocumentBuilder * builder = proc->newDocumentBuilder();
      XdmNode *d = builder->parseXmlFromString("<doc/>");

XMl represented in a file: 
            DocumentBuilder * builder = proc->newDocumentBuilder();
            XdmNode *d = builder->parseXmlFromFile(dir+"books.xml"");

Parsing directly using SaxonProcessor:  
                  SaxonProcessor proc = new SaxonProcessor();
                  XdmNode *inn = proc->parseXmlFromString("<z/>");

The standard collection finder is used and either (a) the URI uses the (non-standard)
        "jar" URI scheme, or (b) the collection URI ends with .zip, .jar,
        or .docx;
